The `TLRUCache` failed to remove existing keys when they were overwritten with a value that is already expired. I fixed this in `src/cachetools/__init__.py` by explicitly deleting the key if it exists in the cache when the new value is expired. I also added a test case in `tests/test_tlru.py` to verify the fix.

